# The Vercel CLI does not fully honour .gitignore, and the visual review loop
# (CLAUDE.md) leaves ~400MB of screenshots, traces and reports in e2e/.
# None of it is part of a build, so keep it out of the upload.
#
# Repo-root entries are anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored
# pattern matches at every depth, so a bare `supabase` would also drop
# apps/admin/src/lib/supabase/ and break that build.

# build output, at any depth
node_modules
.next
out
dist
.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.DS_Store

# repo root only
/e2e
/playwright-report
/playwright.config.ts
/supabase
/.claude
